---
import Swatches from '../../components/Swatches.astro';
import Specimen from '../Specimen.astro';
import type { ColourToken } from '../colour-token';

const brand: ReadonlyArray<ColourToken> = [
    { name: 'Amber', token: '--brand-amber', value: '#F79533' },
    { name: 'Coral', token: '--brand-coral', value: '#F37055' },
    { name: 'Rose', token: '--brand-rose', value: '#EF4E7B' },
    { name: 'Violet', token: '--brand-violet', value: '#A166AB' },
    { name: 'Blue', token: '--brand-blue', value: '#5073B8' },
    { name: 'Cyan', token: '--brand-cyan', value: '#1098AD' },
    { name: 'Teal', token: '--brand-teal', value: '#07B39B' },
    { name: 'Green', token: '--brand-green', value: '#6FBA82' },
];

const neutrals: ReadonlyArray<ColourToken> = [
    { name: 'Page', token: '--bg', value: 'The mid-grey page that surfaces rise from' },
    { name: 'Surface', token: '--surface', value: 'Raised: tiles, cards, buttons' },
    { name: 'Surface, recessed', token: '--surface-alt', value: 'Below the page: card footers, secondary panels' },
    { name: 'Field', token: '--field', value: 'Input wells' },
    { name: 'Edge, light', token: '--edge-light', value: 'The lit top edge of a raised surface' },
    { name: 'Edge, dark', token: '--edge-dark', value: 'The shaded bottom edge' },
    { name: 'Heading', token: '--heading', value: 'Headlines and strong text' },
    { name: 'Text', token: '--text', value: 'Body copy' },
    { name: 'Text, muted', token: '--text-muted', value: 'Standfirsts, captions, the second phrase of a two-tone headline' },
    { name: 'Label', token: '--label', value: 'Coral labels, tuned per theme for contrast' },
];

const intents: ReadonlyArray<string> = ['primary', 'secondary', 'success', 'warning', 'danger', 'info'];

const families: ReadonlyArray<string> = ['aero', 'studio', 'player', 'dotnet', 'kotlin', 'corda'];
const familyNames: ReadonlyMap<string, string> = new Map<string, string>([
    ['aero', 'Aero'], ['studio', 'ONIXLabs Studio'], ['player', 'ONIXPlayer'], ['dotnet', '.NET libraries'], ['kotlin', 'Kotlin libraries'], ['corda', 'Corda libraries'],
]);
---
<Specimen title="Semantic intents" code={'var(--success)  var(--success-contrast)  var(--success-subtle)\n/* primary | secondary | success | warning | danger | info */'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>Stride's intents, each as a fill, the text colour that sits on it, and a subtle background. Primary is monochrome: near-black in light, near-white in dark. Fills are deepened from Stride's values where white text on them fell below 4.5:1.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="intents">
        {intents.map((intent: string) => (
            <div class={`intent intent-${intent}`}>
                <span class="intent-fill">{intent}</span>
                <span class="intent-subtle">subtle</span>
            </div>
        ))}
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Brand stops" code={'<Swatches />\nvar(--brand-amber) … var(--brand-green)\nvar(--brand-gradient)'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes">
        <p>The eight stops of the logo orb. They appear as light (aurora, gradient text), as structure (swatches) and as product identity (colour blocks), but never as a flat accent on buttons.</p>
    </Fragment>
    <div class="brand-grid">
        {brand.map((stop: ColourToken) => (
            <div class={`chip chip-${stop.name.toLowerCase()}`}>
                <span class="chip-colour"></span>
                <span class="chip-name">{stop.name}</span>
                <code>{stop.value}</code>
            </div>
        ))}
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Swatches and gradient" code={'<Swatches class="…" />  /* --swatch-height */\nbackground: var(--brand-gradient);'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>The stops side by side (swatches) mark structure, such as section dividers and the footer. The blended gradient is for light, text and the header's scroll progress.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="stack">
        <Swatches class="swatches-tall" />
        <div class="gradient-bar"></div>
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Neutrals" surface="none">
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>Quiet tokens that switch with the theme. Each pair below shows the light value next to the dark one.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="neutral-pair">
        {['light', 'dark'].map((theme: string) => (
            <div class="neutral-panel" data-theme={theme}>
                <p class="label label-muted">{theme}</p>
                <ul role="list">
                    {neutrals.map((token: ColourToken) => (
                        <li>
                            <span class={`neutral-swatch swatch${token.token}`}></span>
                            <span><strong>{token.name}</strong><code>{token.token}</code><span class="neutral-use">{token.value}</span></span>
                        </li>
                    ))}
                </ul>
            </div>
        ))}
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Product colour blocks" code={'<div class="tile family-block family-aero">…</div>\n/* family-aero | family-studio | family-player | family-dotnet | family-kotlin | family-corda */'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>Each product owns a gradient pair. As a block, the pair is deepened so white text on it clears 4.5:1. Capstone products (Aero, ONIXLabs Studio, ONIXPlayer) lead; the library families are smaller and quieter.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
        {families.map((family: string) => (
            <div class={`tile family-block family-${family} block-sample`}>
                <p class="label">{family === 'aero' || family === 'studio' || family === 'player' ? 'Capstone' : 'Library family'}</p>
                <p class="block-name">{familyNames.get(family)}</p>
            </div>
        ))}
    </div>
</Specimen>

<Specimen title="Mesh" padding="none" code={'<div class="mesh">…</div>'}>
    <Fragment slot="notes"><p>Overlapping brand lights, rich rather than pastel. Artwork behind a product shot or a capstone tile; never behind body text.</p></Fragment>
    <div class="mesh mesh-sample"></div>
</Specimen>

<style>
    .brand-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(7.5rem, 1fr));
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .chip {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.3rem;
        font-size: var(--text-sm);
    }

    .chip-colour {
        height: 5rem;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .chip-amber .chip-colour { background: var(--brand-amber); }
    .chip-coral .chip-colour { background: var(--brand-coral); }
    .chip-rose .chip-colour { background: var(--brand-rose); }
    .chip-violet .chip-colour { background: var(--brand-violet); }
    .chip-blue .chip-colour { background: var(--brand-blue); }
    .chip-cyan .chip-colour { background: var(--brand-cyan); }
    .chip-teal .chip-colour { background: var(--brand-teal); }
    .chip-green .chip-colour { background: var(--brand-green); }

    .chip-name {
        color: var(--heading);
        font-weight: 600;
    }

    .chip code,
    .neutral-pair code {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: var(--text-xs);
    }

    .stack :global(.swatches-tall) {
        --swatch-height: 1rem;
    }

    .gradient-bar {
        height: 3rem;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        background: var(--brand-gradient);
    }

    .neutral-pair {
        display: grid;
        gap: var(--tile-gap);
    }

    @media (min-width: 48rem) {
        .neutral-pair {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }
    }

    .neutral-panel {
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        corner-shape: var(--corner-shape);
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
    }

    .neutral-panel ul {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.9rem;
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .neutral-panel li {
        display: flex;
        gap: 0.9rem;
        align-items: center;
        font-size: var(--text-sm);
    }

    .neutral-panel li > span:last-child {
        display: grid;
    }

    .neutral-use {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: var(--text-xs);
    }

    .neutral-swatch {
        width: 2.5rem;
        height: 2.5rem;
        flex: none;
        border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
        border-radius: 0.6rem;
    }

    .swatch--bg { background: var(--bg); }
    .swatch--surface { background: var(--surface); }
    .swatch--surface-alt { background: var(--surface-alt); }
    .swatch--field { background: var(--field); }
    .swatch--edge-light { background: var(--edge-light); }
    .swatch--edge-dark { background: var(--edge-dark); }
    .swatch--heading { background: var(--heading); }
    .swatch--text { background: var(--text); }
    .swatch--text-muted { background: var(--text-muted); }
    .swatch--label { background: var(--label); }

    .intents {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(9rem, 1fr));
        gap: var(--tile-gap);
    }

    .intent {
        display: grid;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        corner-shape: var(--corner-shape);
        font-size: var(--text-sm);
        font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    }

    .intent span {
        padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    }

    .intent-fill { text-transform: capitalize; }
    .intent-primary .intent-fill { background: var(--primary); color: var(--primary-contrast); }
    .intent-primary .intent-subtle { background: var(--primary-subtle); color: var(--text); }
    .intent-secondary .intent-fill { background: var(--secondary); color: var(--secondary-contrast); }
    .intent-secondary .intent-subtle { background: var(--secondary-subtle); color: var(--text); }
    .intent-success .intent-fill { background: var(--success); color: var(--success-contrast); }
    .intent-success .intent-subtle { background: var(--success-subtle); color: var(--text); }
    .intent-warning .intent-fill { background: var(--warning); color: var(--warning-contrast); }
    .intent-warning .intent-subtle { background: var(--warning-subtle); color: var(--text); }
    .intent-danger .intent-fill { background: var(--danger); color: var(--danger-contrast); }
    .intent-danger .intent-subtle { background: var(--danger-subtle); color: var(--text); }
    .intent-info .intent-fill { background: var(--info); color: var(--info-contrast); }
    .intent-info .intent-subtle { background: var(--info-subtle); color: var(--text); }

    .block-sample {
        display: grid;
        align-content: end;
        gap: 0.4rem;
        min-height: 11rem;
        padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .block-name {
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: var(--text-2xl);
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .mesh-sample {
        height: 16rem;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    }
</style>
